  "thag1.23:0.4": "Thag 1:23 Gosāla ",
  "thag1.23:1.1": "I—having eaten honey-rice\nin a bamboo patch ",
  "thag1.23:1.2": "",
  "thag1.23:1.3": "and rightly grasping the aggregates’ ",
  "thag1.23:1.4": "",
  "thag1.23:1.5": "arising-disbanding—\nwill return to the hillside, ",
  "thag1.23:1.6": "intent\non seclusion. ",
